#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:23
msgid "Enable Blood Overhaul RTX"
msgstr "启用 Blood Overhaul RTX"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:24
msgid "Twenty-six patterns and twelve colour schemes, with wet PBR surfaces under RTX. No separate Blood Overhaul subscription is needed."
msgstr "26 种图案和 12 种配色，RTX 下呈现湿润的 PBR 表面。无需另外订阅 Blood Overhaul。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:25
msgid "Off restores material colours, the mixer and engine impacts. Packaged Blood Overhaul textures and PBR remain until the package is removed."
msgstr "关闭后恢复材质颜色、混合器和引擎血液冲击效果。捆绑的 Blood Overhaul 纹理和 PBR 会保留至移除包。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:26
msgid "Realistic bullet impacts"
msgstr "写实子弹命中效果"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:27
msgid "Directional spray, brief mist and falling droplets that leave small stains. Off restores the engine's blood impact effect."
msgstr "定向喷溅、短暂血雾和落地留下小血迹的液滴。关闭可恢复引擎原有的血液命中效果。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:28
msgid "Impact amount"
msgstr "命中效果量"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:29
msgid "Zero uses the stock impact. Detail reduces with viewing distance; the particle and stain limits always apply."
msgstr "设为零使用原版效果。远处减少细节；粒子和血迹数量始终受上限约束。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:30
msgid "Colour scheme"
msgstr "配色方案"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:32
msgid "Mix all blood patterns"
msgstr "混用所有血迹图案"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:33
msgid "Splat size"
msgstr "血迹大小"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:34
msgid "Recolour flying droplets"
msgstr "为飞溅液滴着色"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:35
msgid "Custom colours apply when the Custom colours scheme is selected."
msgstr "选择“自定义颜色”配色方案后，以下颜色才会生效。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:36
msgid "Red blood"
msgstr "红血"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:37
msgid "Alien blood"
msgstr "异种血液"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:38
msgid "Limits: 640 particles per second, 512 alive; 48 new stains per second, 384 until map cleanup or Clear all decals. Existing stains stay when impacts are turned off."
msgstr "上限：每秒 640 个粒子，同时存在 512 个；每秒 48 处新血迹，清理地图或“清除所有贴花”前累计不超过 384 处。关闭命中效果后已有血迹仍保留。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:39
msgid "Test splats where you look"
msgstr "在准星处测试血迹"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:40
msgid "Clear all decals"
msgstr "清除所有贴花"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:41
msgid "Reset blood settings"
msgstr "重置血液设置"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_blood_menu.lua:42
msgid "Eighteen new patterns made with an AI image model. Blood Overhaul resources by Crunchy (2683396098) and their PBR are bundled. SheepyLord reported the resource author's permission."
msgstr "18 种新图案由 AI 图像模型制作。已收录 Crunchy 的 Blood Overhaul（2683396098）资源及其 PBR 贴图。SheepyLord 表示已获得资源作者许可。"

