msgstr "握紧可抓取。指向松散物体，握紧并甩动手腕可将其拉来。抓住边缘可攀爬。快速挥手或挥动手持物体可击打。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_vr.lua:340
msgid "Turn your wrist to turn what you hold, or hold it with both hands. Pull the trigger while holding to freeze it in place; to free it, grip it and pull the trigger."
msgstr "转动手腕即可转动手中的物体，也可以用双手握住它。握住时按下扳机可将其冻结在原位；要解冻，握紧它并按下扳机。"

#: nativeloader/lua/autorun/client/nativeloader_vr.lua:341
